WEBVTT

00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:03.499
Close reasons shows the reasons your team records on

00:00:03.499 --> 00:00:06.816
won and lost deals, once you point it at those fields.

00:00:06.816 --> 00:00:09.098
“Set up reasons” opens the setting.

00:00:09.098 --> 00:00:12.079
Choose the field your team uses for loss reasons.

00:00:12.079 --> 00:00:14.479
Then choose the field for win reasons.

00:00:15.325 --> 00:00:18.258
“Preview” checks the change before anything is saved.

00:00:18.258 --> 00:00:20.718
Then save, and confirm.

00:00:21.085 --> 00:00:24.165
Close reasons now shows what your team recorded.
